  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Stability Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Stability Fund provides support to a range of activities in developing countries recognising that stable secure environments are critical to enable post-crisis recovery and development to take place. Approximately &#x20AC;1.8 million is allocated to fund the deployment of personnel to Common Security and Defence Policy missions.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Stability Fund supports a range of policy areas including mediation, conflict prevention and resolution, civilian crisis management, post-conflict stabilisation, peacebuilding, disarmament and non-proliferation and activities contributing to the implementation of Ireland&#x2019;s commitments under UNSCR 1325.</narrative>
  </description>
